  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 8 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the mushrooms, tumeric, cumin, paprika, cayenne, salt, and black pepper. Cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the bhuna spice mix and cook for another 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 15-20 minutes, or until the sauce thickens and the flavors have melded together."
